{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788848506434317644,"compiled_state":{"alias":"nosy-sunbeamy-monkey","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"133d86cf58a1bd7df7aad164be29f92b64f1bfd46693afc92617d61798998de9","event_uuid":"73c24e54-2c8d-454f-b7d2-953e71f7b06d","position":{"commit_sha":"d47789697daaa7c0c095a369fe8d4f96e7413b43","position":"1788839556194303001-73c24e54-2c8d-454f-b7d2-953e71f7b06d"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"be0b37e452ad5e57cba07b1d4acce4bcd324b17b9c2ff89b966c6fabda719816","event_uuid":"0c939f90-90f5-4951-b75e-187a059734e7","position":{"commit_sha":"1ccffd6c71e328d8ae2619083f3707625e7e6f4d","position":"1788839585770636001-0c939f90-90f5-4951-b75e-187a059734e7"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788839556194303001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"0c939f90-90f5-4951-b75e-187a059734e7","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"899f-f964-327c-4c47"}],"description":"## Context\nDuring the 2026-09-07 rotation (auspicial-wily-warbler), SSM was treated as the single point of rotation, but two GitHub Actions repo secrets mirroring SSM values went stale: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY and JIRA_API_TOKEN kept their 2026-08-12 values until manually synced on 2026-09-08. Workflows reference: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, GERRIT_SSH_PRIVKEY, JIRA_API_TOKEN, OPENAI_API_KEY, REBAR_BOT_SIGNING_KEY (+ JIRA_URL/JIRA_USER non-secrets). Any secret that lives in BOTH SSM and GitHub Actions must be rotated in both, or CI fails with stale credentials after the old value is revoked.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A documented inventory maps each GitHub Actions secret to its SSM source (or marks it GitHub-only), in the ops runbook that owns rotation (infra/runbooks/).\n- [ ] The rotation runbook includes an explicit GitHub Actions sync step (gh secret set from SSM) with a copy-paste command per mapped secret.\n- [ ] Optional (evaluate): a drift check that compares gh secret updated_at against SSM parameter LastModifiedDate and flags mirrors older than their source, surfaced through an existing operational channel (no new CI-provider-only mechanism; must have an operation-linked or in-process fallback per project.portability).\n\n## Verification\n- Runbook review: rotating any mapped secret following the runbook leaves no stale mirror.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"f116-c8d0-1e69-4361","ticket_type":"task","title":"Secret-rotation procedure must include GitHub Actions secret sync","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["73c24e54-2c8d-454f-b7d2-953e71f7b06d","0c939f90-90f5-4951-b75e-187a059734e7"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788848506434317644,"uuid":"af1f4665-0afe-4e25-95ed-84dbfbce40a7"}